WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.830
Your volunteer page. Your shifts, hours and paperwork, all in one place.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.950
Your page opens with your name at the top. Family on this device? Tap a name to switch.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.588
Paperwork shows whether you're cleared to work, and when each document runs out.

00:00:16.788 --> 00:00:19.861
Your next shift shows the date, the stand, and the time.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:27.770
The stand lead's Call and Text buttons show up closer to the shift. Running late, or can't make it? Call or text them.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:33.122
If something needs attention, it shows here, with an Upload paperwork button.

00:00:33.322 --> 00:00:39.950
Signed up for more than one spot? A pink card asks who's working them. There's a separate video for that.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.601
Tap See all my shifts for a calendar. Blue is coming up. Grey is already worked.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:46.953
Tap a shift,

00:00:47.153 --> 00:00:51.560
to see its details, with the stand lead's Call and Text buttons.

00:00:52.410 --> 00:01:01.520
Hours this season adds up your hours. With two or more students, and more than one volunteer, it shows the whole family's total, with yours next to it.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:05.390
Each student's row shows their total from everyone, and your share.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:13.121
The yellow box is anything waiting for approval. There's a short video, Understanding your hours, that walks through the whole card.

00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:22.740
Sign-ins and my data, at the very bottom, lets you forget people on a shared device, or switch to a dark screen. There's a short video on it.

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:29.415
On a phone, this card puts the Hub on your home screen, so your page is one tap away, like an app.

00:01:29.615 --> 00:01:35.354
On Android, tap Add to home screen, then Install. On an iPhone, the button says Show me how.

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:38.360
Not now hides the card on that phone.

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:49.131
On an iPhone, Apple doesn't let a page add itself, so it shows you the three taps: the dots next to the address bar, then Share, then Add to Home Screen, then Add.

00:01:49.331 --> 00:01:55.720
Then open the new icon and sign in once. It keeps its own sign-in, separate from Safari.

00:01:56.570 --> 00:02:02.565
Hours history lists every shift: the date, the stand, the hours, and the student it counted for.

00:02:02.765 --> 00:02:06.590
Pending shifts are at the bottom, until they're approved.

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.380
Questions? Email the IU liaison from the bottom of any Hub page.
